{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LErdezwQcbpd9JhJrkUW6t","type":"tool_result","content":"1478\t    fn fold_ple_evals(\n1479\t        &mut self,\n1480\t        ctx: &ProvingContext<GenericGpuBackend<HS>>,\n1481\t        r_0: EF,\n1482\t    ) -> Result<(), LogupZerocheckError> {\n1483\t        let l_skip = self.l_skip;\n1484\t        let inv_lagrange_denoms_r0 =\n1485\t            compute_barycentric_inv_lagrange_denoms(l_skip, &self.omega_skip_pows, r_0);\n1486\t        let d_inv_lagrange_denoms_r0 = inv_lagrange_denoms_r0.to_device()?;\n1487\t\n1488\t        let mut mem_limit = self.gkr_mem_contribution;\n1489\t        // GPU folding for mat_evals_per_trace\n1490\t        self.mat_evals_per_trace = ctx\n1491\t            .per_trace\n1492\t            .iter()\n1493\t            .map(|(air_idx, air_ctx)| {\n1494\t                let air_pk = &self.pk.per_air[*air_idx];\n1495\t                let need_rot = air_pk.vk.params.need_rot;\n1496\t                let mut results: Vec<DeviceMatrix<EF>> = Vec::new();\n1497\t\n1498\t                // Preprocessed (if exists)\n1499\t                if let Some(committed) = &air_pk.preprocessed_data {\n1500\t                    let trace = &committed.trace;\n1501\t                    let folded = fold_ple_evals_rotate(\n1502\t                        l_skip,\n1503\t                        &self.d_omega_skip_pows,\n1504\t                        trace,\n1505\t                        &d_inv_lagrange_denoms_r0,\n1506\t                        need_rot,\n1507\t                    )?;\n1508\t                    results.push(folded);\n1509\t                }\n1510\t\n1511\t                // Cached mains\n1512\t                for committed in &air_ctx.cached_mains {\n1513\t                    let trace = &committed.trace;\n1514\t                    let folded = fold_ple_evals_rotate(\n1515\t                        l_skip,\n1516\t                        &self.d_omega_skip_pows,\n1517\t                        trace,\n1518\t                        &d_inv_lagrange_denoms_r0,\n1519\t                        need_rot,\n1520\t                    )?;\n1521\t                    results.push(folded);\n1522\t                }\n1523\t\n1524\t                // Common main\n1525\t                let trace = &air_ctx.common_main;\n1526\t                let folded = fold_ple_evals_rotate(\n1527\t                    l_skip,\n1528\t                    &self.d_omega_skip_pows,\n1529\t                    trace,\n1530\t                    &d_inv_lagrange_denoms_r0,\n1531\t                    need_rot,\n1532\t                )?;\n1533\t                mem_limit = mem_limit.saturating_sub(folded.buffer().len() * size_of::<EF>());\n1534\t                results.push(folded);\n1535\t\n1536\t                Ok(results)\n1537\t            })\n1538\t            .collect::<Result<Vec<_>, FoldPleError>>()?;\n1539\t        if self.save_memory {\n1540\t            self.memory_limit_bytes = mem_limit;\n1541\t        }\n1542\t\n1543\t        // GPU folding for sels_per_trace (rotate=false, only need offset=0)\n1544\t        self.sels_per_trace = std::mem::take(&mut self.sels_per_trace_base)\n1545\t            .into_iter()\n1546\t            .enumerate()\n1547\t            .map(|(trace_idx, selectors_cube)| {\n1548\t                let n = self.n_per_trace[trace_idx];\n1549\t                let num_x = selectors_cube.height();\n1550\t                debug_assert_eq!(num_x, 1 << n.max(0));\n1551\t                debug_assert_eq!(selectors_cube.width(), 3);\n1552\t                let (l, r) = if n.is_negative() {\n1553\t                    (\n1554\t                        l_skip.wrapping_add_signed(n),\n1555\t                        r_0.exp_power_of_2(-n as usize),\n1556\t                    )\n1557\t                } else {\n1558\t                    (l_skip, r_0)\n1559\t                };\n1560\t                let omega = F::two_adic_generator(l);\n1561\t                let is_first = eval_