for s_0 coefficients\n\n3. **Single GPU matrix-vector multiply kernel** writes directly to batch array\n\n### **Required Changes**\n\n1. Pre-compute 3 transformation matrices (one per G_i) during setup\n   - Encode: iDFT + E_i interpolation factors for n ≥ 0\n   - Separate matrices for each n < 0 bucket\n   \n2. Create CUDA kernel similar to `round0_extract_zerocheck_kernel` for stacked reduction\n   \n3. Launch on GPU instead of CPU reconstruction\n   \nThis eliminates D2H + CPU iDFT/DFT overhead, parallelizing across GPU threads.\n\n---\n\n## EXACT FUNCTION SIGNATURES & LINE NUMBERS\n\n| Function | File | Lines | Signature |\n|----------|------|-------|-----------|\n| `prove_stacked_opening_reduction_gpu` | stacked_reduction.rs | 187-272 | Top-level entry point |\n| `batch_sumcheck_uni_round0_poly` | stacked_reduction.rs | 481-556 | Round 0 univariate computation |\n| `stacked_reduction_sumcheck_round0` | cuda/stacked_reduction.rs | 149-174 | GPU kernel wrapper |\n| `_stacked_reduction_sumcheck_round0` | cuda/src/stacked_reduction.cu | 591-629 | Kernel launcher |\n| `stacked_reduction_round0_block_sum_kernel` | cuda/src/stacked_reduction.cu | 104-170 | Core CUDA kernel |\n| `fold_ple_evals` | stacked_reduction.rs | 689-788 | Lagrange interpolation on GPU |\n| `stacked_reduction_fold_ple` | cuda/stacked_reduction.rs | 189-210 | fold_ple GPU wrapper |\n| `reconstruct_s0_from_g` | stacked_reduction.rs | 566-641 | **CPU reconstruction (bottleneck)** |\n| `ntt_multiply_and_add` | stacked_reduction.rs | 645-686 | **iDFT + polynomial multiply (36ms)** |\n| `compute_round0_extract_tables` | logup_zerocheck/mod.rs | 138-209 | **Template: pre-computed transforms** |\n| `round0_extract_zerocheck_kernel` | cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/round0_extract.cu | 23-39 | **Template: GPU matrix-vec kernel** |"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fae41bbf-912e-42ee-9c72-17c79e3a14c7","uuid":"c3b963f0-f1fc-4c62-98c5-1bc009c989a0","timestamp":"2026-04-16T05:18:43.188Z","tool_use_resu