{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01595MqdBobKoARxV3BDUbWa","type":"tool_result","content":"56\t    fn _transpose_fp_to_fpext_vec(output: *mut EF, input: *const F, height: u32) -> i32;\n57\t}\n58\t\n59\t/// Computes the algebraic batch of the column vectors from input matrices `mats`, in order.\n60\t/// In other words, `output = sum_i sum_{j=0..widths[i]} mu_powers[mu_idx[i]] * mats[i][j]`.\n61\t///\n62\t/// # Safety\n63\t/// - `output` must have length `>= height`.\n64\t/// - `mats[i]` must have length `>= widths[i] * height` for all `i`.\n65\t/// - `mats`, `mu_idxs`, `widths` must have length `>= num_mats`.\n66\t/// - `mu_idxs[i] < mu_powers.len()` for all `i`.\n67\tpub unsafe fn algebraic_batch_matrices(\n68\t    output: &mut DeviceBuffer<EF>,\n69\t    mat_ptrs: &DeviceBuffer<*const F>,\n70\t    mu_powers: &DeviceBuffer<EF>,\n71\t    mu_idxs: &DeviceBuffer<u32>,\n72\t    widths: &DeviceBuffer<u32>,\n73\t    height: usize,\n74\t    num_mats: usize,\n75\t) -> Result<(), CudaError> {\n76\t    check(_algebraic_batch_matrices(\n77\t        output.as_mut_ptr(),\n78\t        mat_ptrs.as_ptr(),\n79\t        mu_powers.as_ptr(),\n80\t        mu_idxs.as_ptr(),\n81\t        widths.as_ptr(),\n82\t        height,\n83\t        num_mats,\n84\t    ))\n85\t}\n86\t\n87\t/// Performs an in-place update of:\n88\t/// ```text\n89\t/// out[i + step] = out[i] * x_i\n90\t/// out[i] = out[i] * (1 - x_i)\n91\t/// ```\n92\t/// for `i` in `0..step`.\n93\t///\n94\t/// # Safety\n95\t/// - `out` is **device** pointer with length `>= 2 * step`.\n96\tpub unsafe fn eq_hypercube_stage_ext(out: *mut EF, x_i: EF, step: u32) -> Result<(), CudaError> {\n97\t    check(_eq_hypercube_stage_ext(out, x_i, step))\n98\t}\n99\t\n100\t/// Performs an in-place update for the Möbius-adjusted equality kernel:\n101\t/// ```text\n102\t/// out[i + step] = out[i] * u_tilde_i\n103\t/// out[i] = out[i] * (1 - 2 * u_tilde_i)\n104\t/// ```\n105\t/// for `i` in `0..step`."}]},"parent_t